    {
      "subId": "1110202",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xiao",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111020201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111020201": {
            "id": "111020201",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "It's you... I remember you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020202"
            ]
          },
          "111020202": {
            "id": "111020202",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "I was purging some living beings that had been tainted by the demonic. It would appear that I have caused you some trouble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020203"
            ]
          },
          "111020203": {
            "id": "111020203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "(Huh? He isn't usually this polite, what's going on...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020204"
            ]
          },
          "111020204": {
            "id": "111020204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But you were exorcizing demons, how is that causing trouble?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020205"
            ]
          },
          "111020205": {
            "id": "111020205",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "That is because the changes that occurred in these monsters stem from me — or more precisely, from the karma I have accumulated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020206"
            ]
          },
          "111020206": {
            "id": "111020206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Mutations, karma... Does that mean...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020209"
            ]
          },
          "111020209": {
            "id": "111020209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah. Paimon remembers that Xiao is also called the Vigilant Yaksha, isn't he?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020210"
            ]
          },
          "111020210": {
            "id": "111020210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... so that means... Aww...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020211"
            ]
          },
          "111020211": {
            "id": "111020211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*sniff* P—Poor Xiao...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020212"
            ]
          },
          "111020212": {
            "id": "111020212",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "...?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1110203",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the karma-heavy cavern",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1110204",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111020401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111020401": {
            "id": "111020401",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, this place gives Paimon goosebumps!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020402"
            ]
          },
          "111020402": {
            "id": "111020402",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "I will use the ritual known as the Bane of All Evil to relieve this place of its karma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020403"
            ]
          },
          "111020403": {
            "id": "111020403",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "You must remain calm. Do not allow yourself to be affected by the lingering wrath of bygone gods."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1110206",
      "subQuestName": "Clear the cavern of the hilichurls with the evil aura",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111020601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111020601": {
            "id": "111020601",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "It is good that we came here. An unusual number of living things had fallen under infernal influence. Had we not arrived in good time, the consequences would have been unthinkable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020602"
            ]
          },
          "111020602": {
            "id": "111020602",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Now. This \"Starsnatcher\" you speak of. What is the situation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020603"
            ]
          },
          "111020603": {
            "id": "111020603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, Paimon'll tell you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020604"
            ]
          },
          "111020604": {
            "id": "111020604",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "An adeptus who grants wishes... To think that people could be so easily deceived by such blatant lies...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020605"
            ]
          },
          "111020605": {
            "id": "111020605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "As an adeptus, do you have the power to grant wishes, Xiao?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020606"
            ]
          },
          "111020606": {
            "id": "111020606",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "The Liyue of yesteryear would never ask the adepti for boons unearned.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020607"
            ]
          },
          "111020607": {
            "id": "111020607",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Millennia ago, the ancestral people of Liyue asked for nothing more than the strength to defend the land they called their home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020608"
            ]
          },
          "111020608": {
            "id": "111020608",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ehh... To be honest, an adepti who grants people's wishes is probably more appealing to people nowadays...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020609"
            ]
          },
          "111020609": {
            "id": "111020609",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "However feeble people nowadays may be, they are not my concern. I concern myself only with following Rex Lapis' original decree.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020610"
            ]
          },
          "111020610": {
            "id": "111020610",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoops... Paimon spoke without thinking again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020611"
            ]
          },
          "111020611": {
            "id": "111020611",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, ah, one more thing! That fake adeptus has a Sigil of Permission. It's what he uses to exorcise demons!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020612"
            ]
          },
          "111020612": {
            "id": "111020612",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Wait, truly? Hmph. Fool. Exorcizing demons without exterminating them — it is no wonder they have been congregating here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020613"
            ]
          },
          "111020613": {
            "id": "111020613",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "If this continues, things may spiral out of even my control... We must confiscate his Sigil of Permission.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020616"
            ]
          },
          "111020616": {
            "id": "111020616",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Great minds think alike! Paimon agrees, we've gotta show that trickster what you get for trying to fool us!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020617"
            ]
          },
          "111020617": {
            "id": "111020617",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And it just so happens that we've got a real adeptus with us too! If Xiao were to teach Starsnatcher a lesson, you can bet he'll never dare to pose as an adeptus ever again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020618"
            ]
          },
          "111020618": {
            "id": "111020618",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "No. I only slay demons — I do not kill mortals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020619"
            ]
          },
          "111020619": {
            "id": "111020619",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Who said anything about killing him!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020620"
            ]
          },
          "111020620": {
            "id": "111020620",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020621"
            ]
          },
          "111020621": {
            "id": "111020621",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "It would certainly benefit Liyue if we could convince him to cease his wicked ways.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020622"
            ]
          },
          "111020622": {
            "id": "111020622",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "I possess an art called Dream Trawler. It is normally used to separate the soul from the body, that one might cultivate oneself in a waking dream...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020623"
            ]
          },
          "111020623": {
            "id": "111020623",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "But it can also be used to call forth the spirits of others.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111020624"
            ]
          },
          "111020624": {
            "id": "111020624",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, now that's a real adepti art for ya!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
